        "title": {
          "en": "Taskfold",
          "zh": "Taskfold"
        },
        "description": {
          "en": "Keeps long coding-agent sessions lean: wrap a stretch of work in a named task, and when it ends, fold that whole span into one short titled summary. The conversation stays readable, context costs stay low, and any fold's original content can be read back on demand. Built for DeepSeek Harness.",
          "zh": "长会话不再越滚越重：把一段工作用命名任务包起来，任务结束后，这段对话就折叠成一条带标题的摘要。读起来始终清爽，上下文占用一直很小，折叠掉的原文也能随时按需回读。为 DeepSeek Harness 打造。"
        },
